<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\桔梗実家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo</STYLE>, what are you reading this time...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the several days since meeting <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>, I had been reading a certain book.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was about the geography of this country.<PG>
If only I could find a land called Arata in it―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The land where <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> lived had <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ひ">captured</STYLE> my interest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Arata settlement: though it lay in a remote region, Western culture had blended into it, with none of that 'because you're a man, because you're a woman' thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to go there someday.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For several days, I had been in the grip of that childlike curiosity.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo</STYLE>, are you listening?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, Father..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only then did I realize Father had been speaking to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Usually he did not look kindly on my reading, but today was a little different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His expression was somehow softer.
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo</STYLE>, the man <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>'re to marry has been decided."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Marriage, you say..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ムスカリの花.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE>'re already 16, after all. 
{PAUSE ""}
Ideally it would have been better to wait until <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> had grown a little more womanly, but I believe I've chosen a match worthy of <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had known a day like this would come someday, but to think it would arrive so suddenly.<PG>
In this era, it was a matter of course for the parents to decide on the marriage partner between themselves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were even cases where one did not know one's partner's face until the wedding day itself.<PG>
"I'll introduce you to him next month. 
{PAUSE ""}
Be ready to pack up your things."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, Father left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that was how it was... 
{PAUSE ""}
Was it all over now, then, <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="は">sending</STYLE> my dreams into the future like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I was married, I would not be able to read freely.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\江戸パノラマ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n240000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
―The Emperor's castle, visible from the second floor of our house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What sort of view could one see from that castle?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could one see the Arata settlement where <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> lived?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, the books had not told me where the Arata settlement was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A remote region, where <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> lived.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My mind was on nothing else the whole time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\街並み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="かいわい">neighborhood</STYLE> grew noisy over something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"What's that thing..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Creepy..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A youkai?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I looked down, people were staring at a certain figure.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面横顔右.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone in a Noh mask and the red vestments was walking along, paying no mind to all the attention.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,111,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\街並み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Staying out of sight, I followed that person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I carelessly called out here and now, I would draw strange attention myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was soon to be married, so it would not do for odd rumors to start.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I would call out once there were fewer people around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That person was not necessarily <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>, but had to be someone from the settlement.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> seemed to be heading for the castle, as before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since I had guided him there before, he seemed to remember the way, and he walked on without any sign of getting lost.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, I would have no chance to speak to <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I hurry out in front of <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> and let him see me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then he might notice me and stop.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> was heading somewhere other than the castle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What was more, that way was a dead end, with almost no one passing through.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I was going to speak to him, it had to be now...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I quickened my pace and followed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\路地裏.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Strange...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He had surely gone this way, yet there was no one here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had he gone into one of the houses?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A familiar voice came from behind me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\流るる時.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hahaha, did you follow me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Y-yes, I did! I had been hoping to see you once more!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Are you going to the castle again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. The other day, I was told to come back once more."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then why did you come this way?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, because you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, were following me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Looking the way I do, I thought somewhere out of sight would be better."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But I'm sorry, I have to go to the castle now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But perhaps I might get to see you again, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">With that thought, I decided to stay the night in Tokyo today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So once my business at the castle is done... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">if it's all right with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So saying, <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> looked away a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Y-yes! I'm </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>reeeeeeeally </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>free, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hahaha! Free again today, were you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I saw <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE> off and went back home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At dusk, at the place where we had met earlier, once more...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Um, I should have a new kimono somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh, my hair won't do like this, either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How do I do makeup again...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\桔梗実家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What's this, <STYLE ID="1">Kikyo</STYLE>, got your heart ready to be a bride?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Watching me try to dress up as prettily as I could, Father remarked so.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Yes, I'm going through my things at the same time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Good, good! Honestly, I thought you'd be more against it, so that's a relief!"<PG>
I'm sorry, Father.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There is no need to get my heart ready to be a bride.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, whatever I may feel, I am someone who will be married off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something like that means nothing at all.<PG>
More important is getting ready for tonight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since my marriage has been decided, I will not say I feel no guilt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I only want to talk more with <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>, who knows cultures and learning I have yet to see.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, that is all.<PG>
But why was it that, now that I would soon see <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>, my heart raced?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly, I thought about what lay ahead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the marriage offer were to fall through, and I were to go to <STYLE ID="2">Ko-sama</STYLE>'s homeland―
{PAUSE ""}
Then I would...<PG>
What am I thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am dreaming far too many strange dreams.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As Father says, I should know my place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet...
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
